          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:06e3649f7fd3642ed438baa82d55ebf7a721352753eeececfb508b2bedc2363f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_06cbd389c0fe44979964926618446198",
      "statement": "The session-create route treats environmentId and the repository list as mutually exclusive; an environment launch resolves the member snapshot, resolves it like any list, and records environment_id on the session as launch provenance only — the snapshot, not the live environment, is what the sandbox clones and later environment edits or deletion never affect the running session.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/control-plane/src/db/session-index.ts#L132-L185",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc4f7f3511ae9df0d817ec47bce5a23259fc68c3f842569992d24084eba5d8a9:"
