    {
      "id": "claim_dfd8a3a772b9417fb8368f80cb298926",
      "statement": "Environment sessions receive global + environment secrets only — member repos' secrets never flow into an environment launch (an environment is curated); buildSessionTargetSecretSources owns this policy, while repo-launched/ad-hoc sessions fold member repos in reverse position order so the primary wins collisions.",
