    {
      "id": "claim_c6c3b4be4866445299f2d6d8c0400200",
      "statement": "Prebuilds bake exactly what the environment's sessions receive: loadScopeBuildSecrets folds global + environment secrets for environment scopes (repository scopes fold global + that repo's secrets), with source labels matching the session fold so collision and cap logs attribute identically at build and session time.",
