      "id": "claim_6f6912d1db8a4db69f0f765e19155282",
      "statement": "A scope's prebuild enablement comes from its owning entity: resolveScopeEnabled returns false when the environment is gone or its prebuild flag is off, so a disabled or deleted environment's frozen image never serves at spawn — serving it would drift unboundedly since it never rebuilds.",
