      "statement": "An environment's channel_associations mirrors repo_metadata's: a deduplicated JSON array of Slack channel ids where the empty set collapses to NULL and an absent field on update leaves the column untouched; the Slack classifier's channel-association stage routes associated environments first, then repositories, so a channel targets a workspace the same way it targets a repo.",
