    {
      "id": "claim_05e2b37edfac42cda22b42e0429b33a8",
      "statement": "Managed-skill resolution treats the environment id as part of the session target: listApplicable adds only that environment's scope_type='environment' assignments when environmentId is set (global and repository assignments still apply), and the skills preview route hydrates the member list from the environment store.",
