    {
      "id": "claim_663e4b847aa9466c89c1289e542e13c9",
      "statement": "Environment secrets can be imported from a current member repo ciphertext-verbatim — both scopes share one encryption key so no decrypt/re-encrypt round-trip or plaintext transit is needed — with the route rejecting non-member sources 403 and responses carrying key names only.",
