      "id": "claim_8bc17d384a8d43879df1e2e916af65c1",
      "statement": "Automation runs targeting an environment resolve the workspace at launch time, not firing time: resolveAutomationSessionTarget snapshots the environment's current member list exactly like the session-create route and mirrors the primary into scalar fields; a deleted environment or unresolvable member throws through the launch-failure path.",
